[{"title":"淮阴侯庙","author":"陈孚","text":"汉家罗网政高张，谁有勋名纪太常。\n戏尔筑坛呼大将，危乎操印立真王。\n烟中草木疑残帜，沙上风涛忆故囊。\n钟室千年君莫怨，未央宫殿已斜阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13212,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"漂母冢","author":"陈孚","text":"英雄未遇亦堪羞，一饭区区不自谋。\n莫笑千金酬漂母，汉家更有颉羹侯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13213,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"黄河谣","author":"陈孚","text":"长淮绿如苔，飞下桐柏山。\n黄河忽西来，乱泻长淮间。\n冯夷鼓狂浪，峥嵘雪崖堕。\n惊起无支祁，腥涎沃铁锁。\n两雄斗不死，大声吼乾坤。\n震撼山岳骨，磨荡日月魂。\n黄河无停时，淮亦流不息。\n东风吹海波，万里涌秋色。\n秋色不可扫，青烟映芦花。\n白鸟亦四五，长鸣下汀沙。\n黄灵奠四渎，各剖盘古髓。\n千载今合流，神理胡乃尔。\n渔翁一鬓霜，扁舟依古树。\n隔浦欲扣之，翩然淩波去。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13214,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"清河口","author":"陈孚","text":"百年南北战尘昏，只指长淮作塞垣。\n今日清河河上水，天教洗眼看中原。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13215,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"邳州","author":"陈孚","text":"沂水碧潺潺，汀沙白鸟閒。\n林边郯子国，烟际峄阳山。\n茅屋秋先破，荒城夜不关。\n烹鱼呼浊酒，一笑夕阳间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13216,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"圯桥","author":"陈孚","text":"履印青苔迹未消，一编径佐圣明朝。\n祖龙流毒如洪水，济尽生灵是此桥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13217,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"白门","author":"陈孚","text":"布死城南未足悲，老瞒可是算无遗。\n不知别有三分者，只在当时大耳儿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13218,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"古宿迁 其一","author":"陈孚","text":"淮水东流古宿迁，荒郊千里绝人烟。\n征衣不脱夜无寐，舟在西风乱荻边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13219,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"古宿迁 其二","author":"陈孚","text":"月落狐鸣野草黄，雁飞无数水茫茫。\n数星鬼火寒沙上，知是何年旧战场。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13220,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"吕梁洪","author":"陈孚","text":"沂泗之水来鲁邦，平沙千里流淙淙。\n忽逢吕梁万石硔，势与石斗不肯降。\n半天捲起千尺泷，怒声日夜相摏撞。\n有如万骑腾骊䮾，左挟贲获右羿逢。\n恶若哮虎鼎可扛，踊槊跃矢横矛鏦。\n风云蛇鸟万旌幢，大呼击碎龙文杠。\n死战不复留空羫，我生事业在北窗。\n蒙庄一卷映秋釭，每羡老叟何其憃。\n忠信出入言非哤，及此更觉心悾悾。\n西风吹衣衣茸尨，茅店沽来酒盈缸。\n篙人赠我尺鲤双，扣舷而歌和柷椌。\n问禹何故留此洚，何当理我小舽艭。\n东浮溟海西岷江，沛然一口吸老庞。\n要使后土安鸿厖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13221,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"徐州","author":"陈孚","text":"项王熊豹姿，气欲吞天下。\n大呼渡河来，山岳如崩瓦。\n当其火秦宫，血涌渭水赭。\n嗔目叱诸侯，胆落毛发洒。\n谁知阴陵路，浩歌泪如泻。\n惟徐乃故都，昔此奠宗社。\n尚想岩台上，铁槊拥万马。\n酒酣笳鼓鸣，旌旗蔽原野。\n及今亦何有，荒棘秋满把。\n皇天祚真主，神器不可假。\n岂有时雨师，刈人如土苴。\n天亡君勿悲，为君奠罍斝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13222,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"黄楼","author":"陈孚","text":"长河如带彭城东，乱石蹴起百步洪。\n昔年民歌山鞠藭，孤城汇为河伯宫。\n城上闪闪鲸鬣红，雪堂先生人中龙。\n惊湍偃受丸泥封，手援赤子鱼腹中。\n黄楼千尺雉堞雄，巍梁画栋光昽昽。\n吹笙伐鼓撞歌钟，先生铿然一枝筇。\n麾斥八极绫星虹，酒酣叱起楚重瞳。\n为我拔剑舞西风，卯君作赋声摩空。\n至今读者毛发松，百年事往犹飞鸿。\n我独流涕将何从，孤角一声烟濛濛。\n又送落日沉西峰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13223,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"百步洪","author":"陈孚","text":"大山如飞虬，小山如伏牛。\n天河横空来，声撼山骨浮。\n我偶石上眠，梦惊霹雳怒。\n急起扶瘦筇，恐山亦流去。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13224,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"范增墓","author":"陈孚","text":"七十衰翁两鬓霜，西来一笑火咸阳。\n平生奇计无他事，只劝鸿门杀汉王。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13225,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"泗水","author":"陈孚","text":"落日渔歌何处，白鸥双堕苍烟。\n欲吊周家残鼎，秋风泗水千年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13226,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"燕子楼 其一","author":"陈孚","text":"长相思，久别离，东风不暖残燕支。\n乳鸦困，柔鸾悲，樱桃泫红腻，蘼芜凋绿滋。\n牙床琥珀枕，梦君君不知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13227,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"燕子楼 其二","author":"陈孚","text":"长相思，久离别，珠楼无人但有月。\n翠屏寒，银烛歇，芙蕖为谁怜，丁香空自结。\n泪滴锦襜褕，十年化为血。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13228,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"留侯庙","author":"陈孚","text":"子房王佐才，其风凛冰雪。\n天遣鹤发翁，圯上授宝诀。\n博浪沙中千尺铁，祖龙未死胆已裂。\n况此喑呜扛鼎夫，不直秋风一剑血。\n谈笑帷幄间，六合雄雌决。\n卯金四百年，只在三寸舌。\n但恨汉德非姚虞，不得身为古稷契。\n雍熙至治如可作，岂肯脱冠挂北阙。\n留城古祠今千载，碧藓溜雨眼断碣。\n我恐至人或不死，尚有笙鹤拥玉节。\n酌泉采菊往奠之，回首芒砀堕山月。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13229,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"沛县歌风台 其一","author":"陈孚","text":"沛宫一曲大风歌，谁识尊前感慨多。\n拔木扬沙濉水上，大风中有汉山河。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13230,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"沛县歌风台 其二","author":"陈孚","text":"沛上风云志未酬，彭城先有锦衣游。\n同为富贵归乡者，只是龙颜异沐猴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13231,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"沛县歌风台 其三","author":"陈孚","text":"原庙衣冠久已灰，断碑无首卧苍苔。\n至今风起云飞夜，犹想帝魂思沛来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13232,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"陵母墓","author":"陈孚","text":"太傅勋名半纸残，百年人子痛如山。\n缘何方寸非徐庶，忍死慈亲一剑间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13233,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鲁桥","author":"陈孚","text":"东鲁三家市，长桥压怒涛。\n寒沙秋一雁，残月夜千艘。\n北极天形大，中原地势高。\n百年洙泗上，今得浣征袍。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13234,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜泊济河","author":"陈孚","text":"十日淮沂上，今朝渡济河。\n龟蒙秋烧阔，凫峄夕阳多。\n古寺云笼塔，长亭柳映波。\n鲁邦无孔子，何处听弦歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13235,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题太白酒楼","author":"陈孚","text":"昔闻李太白，山东饮酒有酒楼。\n今我登楼来，北风吹发寒飕飕。\n太白天酒仙，人间不可留。\n金光绛气九万里，翩然而上骑赤虬。\n左蹴大江涛，右翻黄河流。\n手攀北斗招摇柄，琼田倒泻银湾秋。\n银湾吸乾日月液，蟾惊乌泣黄姑愁。\n太白方悠然，掀髯送汀鸥。\n炯如晓霞一点映秋水，红痕微涌玉色浮。\n太虚变化如蜉蝣，仙今何在不可求。\n惟有胸中灿烂五色锦，化为元气包神州。\n我欲起仙从之游，安得羽翮飞上昆崙丘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13236,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"东平府","author":"陈孚","text":"任宿须句国，烟云拥汶河。\n长亭东接岱，短棹北通阿。\n万井楼台壮，千郊衍沃多。\n无盐城突兀，司隶石嵯峨。\n夜月喧箫鼓，春风扇绮罗。\n钿车香不扫，步障锦相摩。\n地尚雄千乘，人犹慕四科。\n故侯敦学校，俊士乐弦歌。\n紫闼悬金榜，朱楼响玉珂。\n自天沾湛露，率土育菁莪。\n衮冕明虫藻，樽罍列象牺。\n淹中书在否，稷下事如何。\n沂咏难逢点，邹迁尚忆轲。\n明朝燕赵去，万事付沧波。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13237,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"望泰山","author":"陈孚","text":"扁舟浮泗来，夜宿须句国。\n眼明忽见玉芙蓉，插天亭亭千丈碧。\n舟人为我言，此乃七十二君之泰山。\n天风吹落黄岘露，冰花乱洒龟蒙间。\n七十二君今何在，宝符朝朝吐光彩。\n千年老鹤巢云松，夜看白日涌东海。\n东海青童仙，踞龟啖蟹螯。\n笑秦亭上攀蟠桃，笑彼鞭石驾长桥。\n天帝之孙奠天极，鲍鱼狂魄腥山色。\n我有东封书，中含万古情。\n欲奏天子甘泉殿，手刻玉检黄金绳。\n寄声为报牵狗老，先向石坛种瑶草。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13238,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"黄石公庙","author":"陈孚","text":"谷城黄石庙，古木白云深。\n黄石有存没，素书无古今。\n老聃三世梦，孺子一生心。\n日落祠门掩，残鸦又满林。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13239,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"管仲井","author":"陈孚","text":"画野分民乱井田，百王礼乐散寒烟。\n平生一勺潢污水，不信东溟浪沃天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13240,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"聊城县","author":"陈孚","text":"七国兵戈若沸羹，诗书谁问鲁诸生。\n君看一纸聊城箭，何似安平十万兵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13241,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"高唐州","author":"陈孚","text":"千里齐郊亦壮哉，扶筇城上独徘徊。\n马随济岱秋风去，雁带关河夜月来。\n驿路映墙榆叶老，渔村带水荻花开。\n吴侬误读襄王传，空向山东梦楚台。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13242,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"陵州","author":"陈孚","text":"五里行尽桑麻畴，十里一见蘋花洲。\n十里五里乌鸟乐，隐隐烟火浮陵州。\n陵州大船腹如鼓，陵州梨枣贱如土。\n陵州女郎金缕衣，低鬟乱拥红窗舞。\n柳衣袅袅萦清河，绿头水禽飞带波。\n箫笙月下不肯饮，一笑如此陵州何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13243,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"景州","author":"陈孚","text":"聊摄之东一千里，昔为青社太公履。\n只今但有无棣沟，榆叶乱拥沙水流。\n车行半夜草露湿，路傍土堠如人立。\n丁当铎摇马不惊，黑天倒垂参昴星。\n吾生百年浪自苦，悲笳一声残月吐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13244,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"广川大夫庙 其一","author":"陈孚","text":"俯察人情仰宪天，素王心事策三篇。\n大夫不向江都死，换尽炎刘四百年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13245,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"广川大夫庙 其二","author":"陈孚","text":"义利从来界限殊，大夫一语破昏愚。\n平生最笑秋风客，只爱黄金灶鬼书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13246,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"阜城县","author":"陈孚","text":"唐帝失金镜，六合无光晶。\n太微摇玉床，影射搀抢星。\n河朔弹丸地，枭獍接踵生。\n乾荦肉未寒，复有史思明。\n鬼马载鬼妾，气薰草木腥。\n天网何尝漏，潴宫穿湿萤。\n我□过逆壤，驱车无留行。\n安得踏东海，飞戈脍长鲸。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13247,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"御庄","author":"陈孚","text":"百年礼乐卯金刀，忍把鸿名冠伪朝。\n树上一声休也曲，路人犹自怨鸱枭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13248,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"献州","author":"陈孚","text":"万里天东北，西风独杖藜。\n雁声秋带魏，树色晓浮齐。\n野阔青烟淡，天空白日低。\n人家在何处，隐隐野狐啼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13249,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"君子馆","author":"陈孚","text":"牢落乾坤一腐儒，征岐半世泣杨朱。\n偶逢孤馆呼君子，夜起挑灯读古书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13250,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"莫州","author":"陈孚","text":"晨出莫州门，回望古易京。\n丹楼不复见，草白寒雉鸣。\n雉角角，枣纂纂，昔谁城此公孙瓒。\n城南城北陂水满，寒蒲如剑出水低。\n大火焚巢天不管，野凫醉眠沙土暖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13251,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雄州","author":"陈孚","text":"燕南垂，赵北际，昔年义城铁可砺。\n城上烽火明如彗，只今残堞黄云曀。\n老榆半枯悬薜荔，市翁叱马声嘒嘒。\n叩以瓦桥潜出涕，英雄虎斗空万世，北风吹沙秋鹤唳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13252,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雄州白沟","author":"陈孚","text":"辽宋兵戈事已休，昔年曾此割神州。\n一衣带水残阳外，犹有人言是白沟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13253,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"涿州","author":"陈孚","text":"晨发白沟河，薄暮宿范阳。\n残城无雉堞，枯木鸣白狼。\n回首望中原，日落烟茫茫。\n天低鹘没处，彷佛见太行。\n缅怀昭烈帝，八尺须眉苍。\n平生汉社稷，志欲为高光。\n惜哉不得就，越在天一方。\n里人亦何知，牲酒奠楼桑。\n车盖不复见，但有秋草黄。\n我来已千载，谁复悲兴亡。\n天明登车去，尘雾沾衣裳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13254,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"良乡县","author":"陈孚","text":"过尽长亭又短亭，燕京初听晓钟声。\n呼童拂拭青藜杖，早挂琴书上帝京。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13255,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏神京八景 其一 太液秋风","author":"陈孚","text":"一镜拭开秋万顷，碧天倒浸琉璃影。\n寒飙夜捲雪波去，贝阙珠宫黛光冷。\n三千棹歌摇绿烟，湿鬟吹堕黄金蝉。\n琪树飕飕红鲤跃，衮龙正宴瑶池仙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13256,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏神京八景 其二 琼岛春阴","author":"陈孚","text":"一峰亭亭涌寒玉，露花不堕瑶草绿。\n珠楼千尺星汉间，天飙吹下笙韶曲。\n万年枝上槲叶满，小鸾伥伥绕龙管。\n金根晓御翠华来，三十六宫碧云暖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13257,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏神京八景 其四 卢沟晓月","author":"陈孚","text":"长桥弯弯饮海鲸，河水不溅冰峥嵘。\n远鸡数声灯火杳，残蟾犹映长庚横。\n道上征车铎声急，霜花如钱马鬣湿。\n忽惊沙际金影摇，白鸥飞下黄芦立。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13258,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏神京八景 其五 西山晴雪","author":"陈孚","text":"冻雀无声庭桧响，冰花洒檐大如掌。\n平明起视岩壑间，插天琼瑶一千丈。\n夕阳微漏光嵯峨，倚栏更觉爽气多。\n云间落叶有径否，想见樵叟犹青蓑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13259,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏神京八景 其六 蓟门飞雨","author":"陈孚","text":"黑云如鸦涨川谷，雷踊电跃风折木。\n半天万点卷海来，森森映窗如银竹。\n凤城无数笙歌楼，珠帘半捲西山秋。\n谁怜羁客家万里，一灯孤拥寒衾愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13260,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏神京八景 其七 玉泉垂虹","author":"陈孚","text":"雪波碧涌千崖高，落花点点浮寒瑶。\n日斜忽奋五彩气，飞上太空横作桥。\n古寺钟残塔铃语，回首前村犹急雨。\n轻绡欲剪一幅秋，又逐西风过南浦。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13261,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏神京八景 其八 金台夕照","author":"陈孚","text":"巍坡十二青云梯，老树偃伏犹躬圭。\n长裾已翳星辰去，残阳空挂卢沟西。\n召南六百年宗社，一日黄金重天下。\n精缠宝气夜不收，又见残霞明朔野。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13262,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"出顺承门","author":"陈孚","text":"又骑官马过中原，袖有芝泥御墨痕。\n岭海孤臣天咫尺，五云回首是都门。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13263,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过卢沟桥","author":"陈孚","text":"去天尺五禁城西，华表亭亭柳拂堤。\n海上飞来双螮蝀，云间拥出万狻猊。\n太行山色浮鲸浪，上国秋声送马蹄。\n谁识太微天极象，迢迢河汉玉绳低。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13264,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"良乡县早行","author":"陈孚","text":"西风黄叶馆，晓起候钟声。\n驿吏张灯送，山童抱褥行。\n短筇秋万里，长剑月三更。\n犹有钧天梦，依稀绕禁城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13265,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"涿州","author":"陈孚","text":"乾坤万里一征骖，马上弯弓胆气酣。\n回首太行青未了，不知身在涿州南。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13266,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"楼桑庙","author":"陈孚","text":"古庙千年后，桑阴满涿州。\n乱山空北向，大火已西流。\n遗恨三分国，英风百尺楼。\n里人牲酒奠，想像衮龙浮。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13267,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"易州","author":"陈孚","text":"白雁飞残水满洲，驿亭疏雨古槐秋。\n平生最恶荆轲事，手障西风过易州。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13268,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"保定府 其一","author":"陈孚","text":"圣明恩重一身轻，英簜荧煌万里行。\n试问黄金台上月，清光此夜为谁明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13269,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"保定府 其二","author":"陈孚","text":"万点寒鸦噪野烟，保州城上夕阳天。\n道傍苔碣麒麟卧，知是谁家旧墓田。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13270,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"中山府 其一","author":"陈孚","text":"马上秋云拥节旄，霜花如雪点征袍。\n要留醒眼看天地，不向山中饮浊醪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13271,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"中山府 其二","author":"陈孚","text":"定武兰亭堕渺茫，愚儒犹护箧中藏。\n我来一笑无他语，独立西风看雁行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13272,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过滹沱河","author":"陈孚","text":"钲鼓连天战血红，存亡只寄寸冰中。\n凭谁剪取鳞鳞碧，画作云台第一功。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13273,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宿赵州驿 其一","author":"陈孚","text":"晋家曲沃旧池台，无数行人去又来。\n可惜石桥三百尺，只留驴迹印青苔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13274,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宿赵州驿 其二","author":"陈孚","text":"揽辔栾城又赵州，清霜点入鬓边秋。\n何如东院老尊宿，不出山门到白头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13275,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"望台","author":"陈孚","text":"北道将军铁锁开，火旗万阵渡河来。\n君臣感会风云际，半在云台半望台。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13276,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鄗南光武庙","author":"陈孚","text":"赤伏真天子，玄圭衮藻明。\n千年高邑庙，一笑下江兵。\n野阔腾龙气，河流渡马声。\n列侯冠剑合，英采俨如生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":13277,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]